2026-07-27T11:24:42.0161953Z i /tmp/RtmplzK6SZ/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:24:42.0162475Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:24:42.0163091Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:24:42.0163614Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:24:42.0164453Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:24:42.0166159Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:24:42.0167345Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
